<title>SPAIN: Spain Dec CPI rose 0.3 pct, yr/yr 3.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Dec CPI rose 0.3 pct, yr/yr 3.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p> SPANISH INFLATION		DEC 96    NOV 96    DEC 95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change	0.3	 0.0	 0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 3.2	 3.2	 4.3</p>
<p> Core inflation		    0.3	 0.0	 0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 3.0	 3.1	 4.8</p>
</text>
